OL,3,GNEWSAOverseas aid charity searching for
OL,4,Avolunteers
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers are being sought for
OL,7,Fprojects being run abroad by a charity
OL,8,Fnext year.
OL,10,FJersey Overseas Aid (JOA) has launched
OL,11,Fits 2027 volunteering programme with
OL,12,Fschemes taking place in Madagascar,
OL,13,FKenya and Nepal.
OL,15,FIt said as part of these projects, the
OL,16,Fcharity would be recruiting three teams
OL,17,Fof between eight and 12 volunteers to
OL,18,Ftravel to the countries and work with
OL,19,Flocal communities.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
